    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Run, Build, and Defend! A New Take on First-Person Tower Defense</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional tower defense games put you in the shoes of a city planner, looking down from above as you place your towers.<br>But not this time.<br>Here, <strong>you</strong> are the worker on the ground \u2014 running, building, and holding the line yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfed Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person, Hands-On Tower Defense</strong><br>Mine resources, build towers, and connect power lines \u2014 all from a first-person perspective!<br>Time is limited, and enemies keep coming. Move fast and stay sharp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Power Management</strong><br>Your power supply is finite. Decide carefully which towers to power and where to spend your resources.<br>Efficient management is the key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Resources &amp; Spend Wisely</strong><br>You'll need to recover resources directly from defeated enemies.<br>Gather minerals, build new defenses, and upgrade your systems to prepare for the next wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend Against Incoming Attacks</strong><br>You have one clear mission:<br>Protect your precious power source from incoming enemy forces.<br>Survive through every stage, hold your ground, and stop them before everything falls apart.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Run, Build, and Defend! A New Take on First-Person Tower Defense</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional tower defense games put you in the shoes of a city planner, looking down from above as you place your towers.<br>But not this time.<br>Here, <strong>you</strong> are the worker on the ground \u2014 running, building, and holding the line yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfed Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person, Hands-On Tower Defense</strong><br>Mine resources, build towers, and connect power lines \u2014 all from a first-person perspective!<br>Time is limited, and enemies keep coming. Move fast and stay sharp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Power Management</strong><br>Your power supply is finite. Decide carefully which towers to power and where to spend your resources.<br>Efficient management is the key to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Resources &amp; Spend Wisely</strong><br>You'll need to recover resources directly from defeated enemies.<br>Gather minerals, build new defenses, and upgrade your systems to prepare for the next wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend Against Incoming Attacks</strong><br>You have one clear mission:<br>Protect your precious power source from incoming enemy forces.<br>Survive through every stage, hold your ground, and stop them before everything falls apart.</p>",
